      <h2>Rice to red gram — guides built for Gadwal soils.</h2>
      <p class="lead" data-i18n="home.solve.sub">Crop-specific guides, pest calendars and IPM plans — written for Gadwal soils and seasons.</p>
      <div class="steps" style="margin-top:22px">
        <div class="step"><div><h3>Tell us the crop</h3><p>Rice, cotton, chilli, groundnut, maize, jowar, red gram, vegetables or fruit orchards.</p></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div><h3>Match the season's pest calendar</h3><p>What's likely in your field this week — stem borer, bollworm, thrips, tikka leaf spot — with thresholds that matter.</p></div></div>
        <div class="step"><div><h3>Act with the right product &amp; dose</h3><p>A labelled AGREXA product, exact ml per litre, water per acre, PPE and the waiting period before harvest.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-green" style="margin-top:26px" href="/crop-solutions">Open Crop Solutions</a>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 style="margin-bottom:18px;color:var(--soil-deep)">Season snapshot — what to scout now</h3>
